{"ref":"BDB, שִׂמְחָה","hw":"שִׂמְחָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחָה</span></big><sub>93</sub>  <strong>n.f. joy, gladness, mirth</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:37\" href=\"/Genesis.31.37\">Gn 31:37</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.2\">Is 9:2</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:6\" href=\"/Psalms.137.6\">ψ 137:6</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמָחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:11\" href=\"/Psalms.16.11\">ψ 16:11</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">ת֗</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:16\" href=\"/Psalms.45.16\">45:16</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>mirth, gladness</em>, e.g. in festivity, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:27\" href=\"/Genesis.31.27\">Gn 31:27</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:3\" href=\"/Psalms.137.3\">ψ 137:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:6\" href=\"/Psalms.137.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:40\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.40\">1 K 1:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.6\">1 S 18:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.2\">Is 9:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.10\">16:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:16\" href=\"/Psalms.45.16\">ψ 45:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם מִשְׁתֶּה וְשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:17\" href=\"/Esther.9.17\">Est 9:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:18\" href=\"/Esther.9.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:22\" href=\"/Esther.9.22\">22</a> cf. (<a data-ref=\"BDB, יוֹם\" href=\"/BDB,_יוֹם\", dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם</a> om.) v <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:19\" href=\"/Esther.9.19\">19</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם טוֹב</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:22\" href=\"/Esther.9.22\">22</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם טוֹב</span>), + 5 times, + <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.34\">Je 7:34</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 16:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.16.9\">16:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.10\">25:10</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.11\">33:11</a>; <em>joy</em> of heart <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.10\">Pr 14:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:19\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.19\">Ec 5:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.11\">Ct 3:11</a>, cf. (of inward joy) <a data-ref=\"Jonah 4:6\" href=\"/Jonah.4.6\">Jon 4:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.23\">Pr 15:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.15\">21:15</a>; = <em>gaiety, pleasure</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.13\">Is 22:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:1\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.1\">Ec 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 8:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.8.15\">8:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 9:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.9.7\">9:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.4\">7:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ חָנֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:5\" href=\"/Job.20.5\">Jb 20:5</a>, of foolish <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.21\">Pr 15:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.17\">21:17</a>; malicious joy <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.15\">Ez 35:15</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> rei), so <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ כָּל־לֵבָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.5\">36:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <sub>46</sub> (especially ψψ Chr) religious: <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.12\">2 S 6:12</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.16\">1 Ch 15:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:16\" href=\"/Joel.1.16\">Jo 1:16</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם שׂ׳</span> 